    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>The project includes building a pigments factory in the second industrial city in Yanbu.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A joint venture between Swiss chemicals producer Clariant and Rowad National Plastic, a wholly owned subsidiary of Tasnee, the plant will produce a range of pigments and dyes widely used in the plastics industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
